  "key_takeaways": [
    "Data leakage audit confirmed 0 base document overlap, 0 cluster overlap, and 0 cross-split hash collisions.",
    "Shortcut audit proved non-semantic metadata leakage (100% accuracy on file size/dimensions alone and 77.2% on CMYK mode).",
    "Preprocessing audit demonstrated frozen model failure under letterboxing (51.56% accuracy), and 6.25% accuracy drop under standardized JPEG recompression.",
    "Dedicated patch classifier achieves 99.38% test accuracy when guided by ground-truth crops, confirming microscopic forgery artifacts exist at native sensor scale.",
    "Autonomous production-equivalent local inspection achieves 74.06% accuracy with canonical layout priors and 68.75% with uniform sliding tiles (mean aggregation, AUC 0.8023).",
    "Multi-modal evidence fusion combines global CNN, local canonical patch, ELA, noise residual, and semantic OCR, achieving 91.88% accuracy (AUC 0.9780) under fully autonomous, zero-ground-truth production conditions.",
    "Statistical validation via 5,000 bootstrap iterations yields 95% CI of [88.75%, 94.69%] for Phase 6 Production Fusion vs [75.31%, 84.06%] for Phase 2 Baseline.",
    "McNemar's paired test proves the improvement is highly statistically significant (p = 1.47e-8, Chi2 = 32.09).",
    "Environmental stress testing reveals progressive graceful degradation under JPEG recompression (Q=30: 54.69%), blur (sigma=3.0: 55.31%), and downscaling (scale=0.35: 56.25%)."
  ]
}